<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-HCIA cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-HCIA cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HCIA Inc was cut to a near-term neutral from a buy at Merrill Lynch. Merrill said the stock was still considered a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- HCIA shares fell to 32 in preopening trade from its Monday close of 60 after it warned of weak third and fourth quarter earnings after the market close Monday.</p>
</text>
